WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.586
Hi! How can we share 7 sweets between two people? Today we'll learn number bonds.

2
00:00:08.736 --> 00:00:13.698
A number can be split into two parts: 7 is 3 and 4.

3
00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:17.562
The other way round, 3 and 4 make 7.

4
00:00:17.712 --> 00:00:24.042
7 can be split in many ways: 1 and 6, 2 and 5, 3 and 4.

5
00:00:24.192 --> 00:00:30.258
Draw a big circle for the whole and two small circles for the parts.

6
00:00:30.408 --> 00:00:39.018
Number pairs that make 10: 1 and 9, 2 and 8, 3 and 7, 4 and 6, 5 and 5.

7
00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:43.962
10 is 6 and what? 6 and 4 make 10, so it's 4.

8
00:00:44.112 --> 00:00:49.698
Two hands have 10 fingers. Fold some down; the rest is the other part.

9
00:00:49.848 --> 00:00:55.170
3 and 4, or 4 and 3, both make 7.

10
00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:59.562
Watch out! 4 and 5 make 9, not 8!

11
00:00:59.712 --> 00:01:03.762
Always check: the two parts must add up to the whole.

12
00:01:03.912 --> 00:01:08.946
8 can be 4 and 4, or 3 and 5.

13
00:01:09.096 --> 00:01:16.890
Your turn! 6 is 2 and what? Pause and think.

14
00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:22.194
2 and 4 make 6. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:30.234
Another one! 10 is 7 and what? Pause and think.

16
00:01:30.384 --> 00:01:35.538
7 and 3 make 10. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:35.688 --> 00:01:43.722
Here's another! What do 5 and 4 make? Pause and think.

18
00:01:43.872 --> 00:01:49.122
5 and 4 make 9. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:49.272 --> 00:01:56.994
Try one more! 9 is what and 1? Pause and think.

20
00:01:57.144 --> 00:02:02.226
8 and 1 make 9. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:02.376 --> 00:02:12.282
Try one more! 4 and 5, or 6 and 4: which pair makes 10? Pause and think.

22
00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:19.626
6 and 4 make 10; 4 and 5 only make 9. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:19.776 --> 00:02:29.514
Try one more! Split 8 into two numbers. Give one way. Pause and think.

24
00:02:29.664 --> 00:02:37.290
5 and 3 works; so do 4 and 4, or 6 and 2. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:45.042
Last one! 4 and what make 10? Pause and think.

26
00:02:45.192 --> 00:02:50.274
4 and 6 make 10. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:50.424 --> 00:02:57.882
Remember: a number splits into two parts, and the parts must add up to the whole. Learn the pairs that make 10.

28
00:02:58.032 --> 00:03:04.121
Take 10 beans, split them into two piles, and find all the ways!

